---
/* Consent banner. Analytics and ad personalization stay off (Consent Mode "denied") until the visitor opts in. */
---

<div class="cookie-banner" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="cookie-title" aria-describedby="cookie-desc" data-cookie-banner hidden>
  <h2 id="cookie-title">Cookies, your call</h2>
  <p id="cookie-desc">
    We use essential storage to run the site (like your saved trips). With your permission we and our partners, including Google, also use
    cookies for analytics and personalized ads. Without it, any ads shown are non-personalized. Read our <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a>
    and <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
  <div class="cluster">
    <button class="btn btn--sm" type="button" data-consent="accept">Accept all</button>
    <button class="btn btn--sm btn--ghost" type="button" data-consent="reject">Essential only</button>
  </div>
</div>
